<reference name="reStructuredText interpreted text roles" refuri="roles.html">reStructuredText interpreted text roles</reference>.</paragraph><target ids="role-directive" names='"role"\ directive' refuri="directives.html#role"></target><target ids="restructuredtext-interpreted-text-roles" names="restructuredtext\ interpreted\ text\ roles" refuri="roles.html"></target><section ids="additional-roles-for-html" names="additional\ roles\ for\ html"><title refid="toc-entry-4">Additional roles for HTML</title><paragraph>The "<reference name="html-roles.txt" refuri="../../../docutils/parsers/rst/include/html-roles.txt">html-roles.txt</reference>" standard definitions file provides role
