do not have a corresponding standard rST role
(except for elements requiring an additional attribute).</paragraph><paragraph>The additional roles work out of the box with the <reference name='"html5" writer' refuri="../../user/html.html#html5">"html5" writer</reference>
that selects the corresponding HTML element.
